; Each rule re-verifies the transaction as it extends it, so the first
; rule already rejects the entry, even though a second rule would cancel
; the residual of the first (src/xact.cc:1677-1684,
; xact_base_t::verify at src/xact.cc:1040-1110).

= /Food/
    Assets:Savings    0.1

= /Food/
    Assets:Savings    -0.1

2026/01/01 lunch
    Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
